.claude/

# Build output — regenerated by build.ps1, never edit or commit
dist/

# Shipped release artifacts ARE kept for trace-back / store audit.
# Ignore stray zips everywhere else.
*.zip
!releases/**/*.zip

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Store listing artwork: screenshots, promo tiles, marquee banners, canvases.
# These are marketing deliverables, not build inputs — build.ps1 never reads
# store-assets/. They are large, get re-exported often, and would otherwise
# bloat every clone.
#
# NOTE: these files then live only on the local disk. Keep your own backup;
# git will not have them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
store-assets/**/*.png
store-assets/**/*.jpg
store-assets/**/*.jpeg
store-assets/**/*.webp

# Keep the written store material — that IS tracked.
!store-assets/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# design/ is deliberately NOT ignored. icon.svg and icon-master.png are the
# sources the shipped src/icons/*.png are rendered from. A 128px PNG cannot be
# scaled back up, so losing the master means the logo cannot be regenerated at
# any new size. They are build inputs in every sense that matters.
#
# src/icons/*.png is likewise tracked on purpose — those files are packaged
# into the extension itself.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
